Faucet (26.2 port) - PRIVATE USE ONLY

This mod is a private, non-public port of the Faucet block from Supplementaries
by MehVahdJukaar and Plantkillable (https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/supplementaries).
Textures, models and sounds are taken from Supplementaries.

